  "notes": "# OverCue Desktop 2.2.65 for Mac\n\n- **DJM-900NXS2 Stems EQ** is now available as a preview. Select DJM-900NXS2 under Mixers and choose the official 2.08 update file to create the patched update on your computer. After installation the mixer reports version 2.09.\n- On the 900NXS2, LOW controls Drums, MID controls Vocals, and HIGH controls Harmonics / Other. Requires prepared stems and OverCue CDJ-3000 firmware 1.0.1 or later. To return to stock, reinstall the official 2.08 update.\n",
